nchmark amounts of ordinary creatine monohydrate powder."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Con-cret Reinforced\nTrademarks of Vireo Systems, Inc. Creatine HCl is covered by one or more patents: www.vireosystems.com/patents/\n"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Clinically studied with Enhanced Bioavailability\n189% Superior Absorption vs. Ordinary Creatine\nIncrease Strength & Performance with 1/4 the Dose"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Directions: As a dietary supplement, take two tablets daily. Studies have shown that taking creatine is beneficial before, during or after exercise. Take GNC AMP Creatine HCl 189 daily at a time convenient for you. Consume ample amounts of water while taking this product."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Warning: Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication, under 18 years of age or have a medical condition."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Discontinue use two weeks prior to surgery."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No sugar, no starch, no artificial flavors, no wheat, gluten free, no corn, no dairy."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Conforms to USP <2091> for weight."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"This statement has not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"120-day supply"},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Warning: Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication, under 18 years of age or have a medical co